==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*20 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*30 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*30 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*30 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*20 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*20 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*20 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
*20 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage will be pretty easy if you have [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], as it can deliver heavy damage to THE SLOTH and the peons. Meatshields and general attackers like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] are recommended for this stage. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] is also recommended since it can snipe THE SLOTH, Mr. Mole and clear out the peons.

